        "score": 75.0,
        "cleanliness_and_arguments": "Excellent formatting, clear itemization, and a distinct signature block for the 37 CFR 1.125(b) certification. The fee allocation instructions are precise.",
        "risks_and_liabilities": "CRITICAL RISK: Deferring the base filing fees when responding to a Notice to File Missing Parts that already demanded them will result in an incomplete reply and subsequent abandonment once the 5-month extension expires.",
